WEBVTT

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.100
Look,dad's gone now,

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.070
and we have to carry out his legacy -- 

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:58.920
hunting down as many evil sons of bitches as we possibly can.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:05.050
John: Back in 1835,samuel colt made a gun for a hunter.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.810
This gun can kill anything.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.720
There's only four bullets left.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:14.540
Without em,this gun is useless.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.490
Only thing it's good for now is figuring out what makes it tick.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.379
Cute piece.Won't stop a demon.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:21.550
How the hell would you know?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.200
Call it an educated guess.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:27.750
Do you want me to help you out with that gun or not?

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.720
That deal you made to save sam -- 

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:31.879
a year left.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.280
Been kind of liberating,actually.

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.910
You're not scared?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.160
Of course not.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:45.730
How certain are you that what you brought back is 100% pure sam?

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.250
You think something's wrong with my brother?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.330
Demons lie.I'm sure sam's okay.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.170
Yeah,me too.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.759
now

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.030
Hey,what was that?

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.160
I don't know,a dog maybe.

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:23.600
It was a hell of a dog.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.960
Okay,we got a crew coming in the morning.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.320
Look at this wood,huh?

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:28.730
Look at it.It's crap.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:29.920
Where'd you order it from?

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:31.050
Same place as always.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.390
Should have used the cinder block like I wanted.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.570
-Here we go again. -You are not in charge.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.810
You're a bunch of girls.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.450
Look,it comes down to this,okay?

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:41.570
One gust of wind,and the whole place is gonna blow over.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.310
Whatever.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.240
Did you hear that? -Hear what?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.990
Kyle,come on.Let's go.

00:14:18.009 --> 00:14:19.750
Okay,I'm gonna go warm up the truck.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.970
Jack!

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:19.519
<font color="#ffff00">supernatural Season 3 Episode 5</font>

00:15:24.029 --> 00:15:26.180
bedtime stories

00:15:26.769 --> 00:15:30.070
<font color="#ffff00">sync:YTET-˽ -=www.ydy.com/bbs=-</font>

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.300
<font color="#ffff00">-=www.ydy.com/bbs=- proudly presents</font>

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.700
I don't understand,dean.Why not?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.250
Because I said so.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.900
We got the colt now. -Sam.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:48.110
We can summon the crossroads demon,pull the gun on her,and force her to let you out of the deal.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.150
We'll just shoot her!If she dies,the deal goes away!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:51.570
We don't know if that will work either,sam!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.110
You're pitching me a bunch of "ifs" and "maybes"!

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:55.280
That's not good enough!

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.320
Because if we screw with this deal,you die!

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.759
And if we don't screw with it,you die!

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.830
Sam,enough!I'm not gonna have this conversation!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.200
Why,because you said so?

00:16:02.259 --> 00:16:03.380
Yes,because I said so!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.150
Well,you're not dad!

00:16:07.509 --> 00:16:09.450
No,but I am the oldest.

00:16:09.509 --> 00:16:10.900
And I'm doing what's best.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.910
You got to let this go.You understand me?

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:24.320
Tell me about the psychotic killer.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.460
Come on,sam,tell me about the psychotic killer.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:31.759
"The psychotic killer rips victims apart with brute-like ferocity.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:36.160
" Okay,any mention of his razor-sharp teeth or his 4-inch claws,animal eyes?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.830
No.

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:40.360
The lunar cycle's right.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.720
Look,if it is a werewolf,we don't have long.

00:16:42.779 --> 00:16:45.820
Moon's full this friday,and that's the last time it changes for a month.

00:16:46.519 --> 00:16:48.480
Two days.No sweat.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.279
I'm detective plant.This is detective page.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.240
We're with the county sheriff's department.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.350
Yeah,I've been expecting you.

00:16:58.769 --> 00:17:00.560
All morning.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.890
You are the sketch artts,right?

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.519
absolutely.

00:17:06.309 --> 00:17:08.380
That is exactly who my partner is.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.400
The things he can do with a pen.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.380
But listen,before we get started on that,I wanted to ask you -- how'd you get away?

00:17:17.009 --> 00:17:19.079
I-I have no idea.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.640
I was hiding,and he found me.

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:27.470
He was coming right for me,and then he just stopped.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.759
Stared at me with this blank look.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:35.279
After that,he just took off running.

00:17:37.769 --> 00:17:39.599
Okay.

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:43.990
Um,I'm gonna need as much physical detail as you can remember.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.620
he was about 6' tall...

00:17:50.059 --> 00:17:52.070
Dark hair.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.220
Um,what about his eyes?What color eyes did he have?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.789
Maybe...

00:17:57.829 --> 00:17:58.990
blue?

00:17:59.029 --> 00:18:00.450
It was dark.

00:18:00.529 --> 00:18:03.480
Did they seem,uh,animal-ish?

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:04.789
Excuse me?

00:18:04.849 --> 00:18:08.320
What about his teeth?You notice anything strange about them?

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.250
No,they were just teeth.

00:18:11.289 --> 00:18:12.250
Teeth.Okay.

00:18:12.329 --> 00:18:14.070
How about his fingernails?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:20.769
Okay,look,he's -- he's just a normal guy with normal eyes and teeth and fingernails.

00:18:20.849 --> 00:18:24.800
Look,sir,it's okay -- no.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.590
No.Those were my brothers.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.690
This guy...

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.630
he killed my brothers.

00:18:34.099 --> 00:18:36.170
How would you feel?

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.420
Can't imagine anything worse.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.480
I know this isn't easy,but if you could remember any more details...

00:18:50.539 --> 00:18:53.009
there was one more thing.He had a -- 

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.259
a tattoo on his arm of a cartoon character.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:59.610
Uh,ugh,it's the guy who -- he's chasing the roadrunner.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.400
Wile E.Coyote.

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:02.460
Yeah,that's it.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.769
Kyle?

00:19:04.829 --> 00:19:05.980
Dr.Garrison.

00:19:06.039 --> 00:19:07.029
How you holding up?

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.470
Okay,considering...

00:19:08.559 --> 00:19:10.079
you're,uh,kyle's doctor?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.450
Yes.

00:19:11.509 --> 00:19:13.150
Can I just ask you a few questions?

00:19:14.329 --> 00:19:15.820
Sure.

00:19:19.559 --> 00:19:21.250
Don't I get to see it?

00:19:29.079 --> 00:19:32.009
Um,yeah,it's a,you know,work in progress.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.300
It's really...

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.890
Boy,this is a piece of art,really.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.849
Yeah,like you could have done any better.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.370
So,what did the doc have to say about kyle's brothers?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.150
Not much.They were D.O.A.At the scene.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.079
He did give me the lowdown on the coroner's report.

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.009
Their hearts were missing.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.870
Nope,but chunks of their kidneys,lungs,and intestines.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.079
That's just gross.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.340
Yeah,alefinitely not werewolf behavior.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.559
So,what -- demon?

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:03.769
Attacker could have been possessed.

00:20:03.809 --> 00:20:05.730
Why would a demon stop halfway through an attack?

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:10.079
I think that,uh,could've -- yeah,I got nothing.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.730
Me,neither.

00:20:15.519 --> 00:20:17.460
Okay,I am starving.

00:20:18.759 --> 00:20:20.160
Wait,where are all the powerbars?

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.500
You ate them all.

00:20:21.559 --> 00:20:22.869
And we're lost.

00:20:23.349 --> 00:20:26.150
We're not lost.The path is right here.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:39.150
Look.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.910
There.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:43.509
Civilization.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:46.320
Thank god.

00:20:57.829 --> 00:20:59.630
Are you two doing okay?

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.920
Hi,actually we're -- lost.

00:21:02.039 --> 00:21:03.240
Oh,it happens.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:07.610
The trail gets twisty,and my house is the only one left up here.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:16.430
I could point you in the right direction,but I'm afraid it'll take a while to get back.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:21.190
You're really deep into the woods.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.660
Nice work,ken.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.240
Would you like to come in and rest a bit?

00:21:33.099 --> 00:21:35.550
Thanks,but we should head back.

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.960
Come on,honey.She offered.

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:40.539
She's a harmless old lady.What could happen?

00:22:04.539 --> 00:22:06.530
You sure you don't want more?

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:10.059
No,thank you.It's,uh...

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.900
I'm full.

00:22:15.039 --> 00:22:16.820
We should go.

00:22:17.289 --> 00:22:19.450
We really can't thank you enough.

00:22:28.369 --> 00:22:30.220
What's going on?

00:22:31.039 --> 00:22:34.030
Are we -- did she drug us?

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.840
Stop.

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.700
Please,you have to stop.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:58.769
Don't worry.

00:22:58.829 --> 00:23:00.840
Everything's fine.

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:03.340
You just hold still now,dear.

00:23:11.769 --> 00:23:13.119
Stop it!

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:15.150
Stop!

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:18.780
Why are you doing this to us?

00:23:52.670 --> 00:23:54.320
ComPlease.

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:56.599
We need to observe you while the drugs still may be in your system.

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:59.309
I have things to do,arrangements I need to make.

00:23:59.369 --> 00:24:01.039
It can wait.

00:24:01.099 --> 00:24:02.910
Now,you need to rest.

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:05.400
Stay,please.

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:07.530
I'll be back in a few minutes.

00:24:11.210 --> 00:24:12.170
Detectives.

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:13.910
Dr.Garrison.

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:16.599
What the hell's going on here?

00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:17.960
My whole town's going insane.

00:24:18.039 --> 00:24:19.630
We'll let you know as soon as we do.

00:24:25.329 --> 00:24:27.130
Miss watson?

00:24:28.050 --> 00:24:30.019
Need to ask you a few questions.

00:24:30.079 --> 00:24:32.349
Do we have to go over this again?

00:24:32.450 --> 00:24:33.590
Now?

00:24:33.630 --> 00:24:35.400
We'll try to be brief.

00:24:36.130 --> 00:24:38.829
Miss watson,can you tell us how you got away?

00:24:41.200 --> 00:24:45.570
I didn't eat as much as ken did,so I wasn't as out of it.

00:24:47.110 --> 00:24:50.820
And when the old woman was...

00:24:51.519 --> 00:24:55.920
carving up ken,I shoved her.

00:24:55.970 --> 00:24:59.660
And she fell,cracked her head on the stove.

00:25:01.940 --> 00:25:03.710
She's dead,right?

00:25:03.789 --> 00:25:06.019
I-I killed her?

00:25:06.740 --> 00:25:08.970
Do you have any idea why she did this to you?

00:25:09.200 --> 00:25:10.509
No.

00:25:10.550 --> 00:25:17.400
One minute,she's just a sweet old lady,and the next,she was like a monster.

00:25:18.950 --> 00:25:21.590
Can you remember anything else?

00:25:27.809 --> 00:25:31.430
Did you find a little girl there,by any chance?

00:25:31.490 --> 00:25:33.099
A little girl?

00:25:33.180 --> 00:25:34.740
At the house?

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:37.440
I thought I saw her outside the window.

00:25:38.559 --> 00:25:41.309
S-she just disappeared...

00:25:41.579 --> 00:25:44.769
just vanished into thin air.

00:25:46.490 --> 00:25:48.690
It must have been the drugs.

00:25:48.730 --> 00:25:51.009
This disappearing girl,what did she look like?

00:25:51.090 --> 00:25:52.269
Does it matter?

00:25:52.349 --> 00:25:54.700
Yes,every detail matters.

00:25:56.720 --> 00:26:03.019
She had this dark,dark hair and really pale skin.

00:26:03.079 --> 00:26:05.190
She was around 8.

00:26:05.269 --> 00:26:08.480
She was a beautiful child.It was...

00:26:08.539 --> 00:26:13.030
odd to see her in the middle of something so horrible.

00:26:21.180 --> 00:26:22.450
Well,there's no sulfur anywhere.

00:26:22.490 --> 00:26:24.070
How about the emf?

00:26:24.369 --> 00:26:28.320
Yeah,it's going nuts when I went over here by the window.

00:26:28.369 --> 00:26:30.009
There was definitely a spirit here.

00:26:30.050 --> 00:26:32.509
Who stood outside the crime scene and watched?

00:26:34.300 --> 00:26:35.750
Looks like.

00:26:35.789 --> 00:26:36.910
What the hell do you make of that?

00:26:36.970 --> 00:26:38.349
Actually,I do have a theory.

00:26:38.400 --> 00:26:39.940
Uh,sort of.

00:26:40.530 --> 00:26:41.820
Hit me.

00:26:41.920 --> 00:26:44.430
Well,thinking about fairy tales.

00:26:46.160 --> 00:26:48.300
Oh,that's -- that's nice.

00:26:48.440 --> 00:26:49.920
You think about fairy tales often?

00:26:49.980 --> 00:26:51.800
No,dean,I'm talking about the murders.

00:26:51.860 --> 00:26:53.990
A guy and a girl hiking through the woods.

00:26:54.059 --> 00:26:55.559
An old lady tries to eat them.

00:26:55.619 --> 00:26:56.910
That's "hansel and gretel.

00:26:56.970 --> 00:27:01.269
" Then we got the three brothers arguing over how to build houses attacked by the big bad wolf.

00:27:01.309 --> 00:27:03.110
"Three little pigs.

00:27:03.360 --> 00:27:05.259
Actually,those guys were a little chubby.

00:27:05.920 --> 00:27:09.190
Well,wait,I thought all those things ended with everybody living happily ever after.

00:27:09.230 --> 00:27:10.550
No,no.Not the originals.

00:27:10.630 --> 00:27:16.400
See,the grimm brothers' stuff was kind of like the folklore of its day -- full of sex,violence,cannibalism.

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:21.730
Then it got sanitized over the years,turned into disney flicks and bedtime stories.

00:27:21.809 --> 00:27:25.140
So,you think the murders are,what,a re-enactment?

00:27:25.180 --> 00:27:26.230
It's a little crazy.

00:27:26.289 --> 00:27:27.360
As crazy as what?

00:27:27.410 --> 00:27:29.009
Every day of our lives?

00:27:29.280 --> 00:27:30.590
Touch?

00:27:30.650 --> 00:27:32.380
How's the creepy ghost girl involved?

00:27:33.470 --> 00:27:36.910
Um,she must have been here for a reason.

00:27:37.009 --> 00:27:40.410
I'm willing to bet you top dollar she was at the construction site,too.

00:27:40.450 --> 00:27:42.130
We got to do research now,don't we?

00:27:49.289 --> 00:27:51.539
-So? -Checked every record they had.

00:27:51.670 --> 00:27:55.329
Found the usual amount of violent childhood deaths for a town this size.

00:27:55.369 --> 00:27:58.759
Do you want to know how many were little girls with black hair and pale skin?

00:27:58.780 --> 00:28:00.470
Zero.

00:28:00.530 --> 00:28:03.670
Do you want to know how many little girls with black hair and pale skin have gone missing?

00:28:03.730 --> 00:28:04.880
Right again.

00:28:04.940 --> 00:28:07.119
Zip,zilch,nada.

00:28:07.180 --> 00:28:10.200
Tell me you got something good,'cause I've totally wasted the last six hours.

00:28:11.050 --> 00:28:12.780
Well,you ever hear of lilian bailey?

00:28:12.840 --> 00:28:15.539
She was a british medium from the 1930s.

00:28:15.599 --> 00:28:17.099
She got a thing for fairy tales?

00:28:17.160 --> 00:28:18.440
No,trances.

00:28:18.500 --> 00:28:21.309
See,she'd go into these unconscious states where,um -- 

00:28:21.369 --> 00:28:26.220
get this -- her thoughts and actions were completely controlled by spirits.

00:28:26.280 --> 00:28:28.140
A ghost puppet master?

00:28:28.230 --> 00:28:29.680
You think that's what this kid is doing?

00:28:29.740 --> 00:28:33.269
Sending wolf boy and grandma into trances and making them go kill-crazy?

00:28:33.700 --> 00:28:35.059
Could be.

00:28:35.119 --> 00:28:37.950
You know,kind of like a spirit hypnosis or something.

00:28:38.030 --> 00:28:40.500
Trances I get,but fairy-tale trances?

00:28:40.559 --> 00:28:42.320
That's bizarre,even for us.

00:28:47.200 --> 00:28:50.800
you're right.That's completely normal.

00:28:51.710 --> 00:28:53.690
All right,maybe it is fairy tales 

00:28:53.750 --> 00:28:56.910
-- totally messed-up fairy tales.

00:28:57.240 --> 00:29:00.660
I'll tell you one thing.There's no way I'm kissing a damn frog.

00:29:03.690 --> 00:29:06.380
Hey,check that out.

00:29:07.600 --> 00:29:09.590
Yeah,it's close to halloween.

00:29:11.110 --> 00:29:12.980
You remember cinderella?

00:29:13.690 --> 00:29:18.269
The pumpkin that turns into a coach and the mice that become horses.

00:29:20.690 --> 00:29:22.870
Dude,could you be more gay?

00:29:26.360 --> 00:29:28.330
Don't answer that.

00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:41.660
Oh,who knows?Maybe you'll find your fairy godmother.

00:30:07.940 --> 00:30:09.819
Help!I'm in here!

00:30:11.519 --> 00:30:13.230
It's okay.We're here.We got you.

00:30:13.299 --> 00:30:15.350
You have to help me.She's a lunatic. -what happened

00:30:15.430 --> 00:30:19.450
My stepmom -- she just freaked out,screamed at me,beat me,chained me up.

00:30:19.509 --> 00:30:21.390
Where is she now? -idont know

00:30:23.130 --> 00:30:25.250
Sam.

00:31:14.830 --> 00:31:16.990
Who are you?

00:31:43.150 --> 00:31:44.860
Paramedics picked up cinderella.

00:31:44.920 --> 00:31:46.150
That's good.

00:31:46.210 --> 00:31:48.980
So,little girl,shiny red apple.

00:31:49.090 --> 00:31:51.019
That means something to you,fairy-tale boy?

